{"v":4,"catch":"鑑賞家的謎題。\n你準備好接受挑戰了嗎？","desc":"\"Hitori \"是一個謎題，你要填上任何不必要的數字，確保同一個數字不會在同一行中出現兩次。一旦你掌握了這個技巧，你就可以感受到創作者想出的許多不同的噱頭的樂趣。這是一個真正的行家的謎題。\n\n選項菜單、手冊和其他文字都有日語、英語、法語、德語、意大利語和西班牙語版本。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-07-13","genres":["益智","桌上遊戲","訓練","學習"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f427e8bd59ba8de34d7d6225123729ec896570d70854ced41ebccbf6cf789c9c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dc9fbc6e4b94f376b31e6bd72da59e6ed4157c1a4c2de784e8780b352f20e6cd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a50265818b487d994ab8cc01f55ccdee25373710d54e5d17be41b8c3846d63fe.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0e34b81018a326f6257bcf9421d117c6dadf523698ad9911ff9a5a721820e008.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2f22dc4d24421d31a28092f4d417cfe2b5d62697f55fe320dae98a251286e5af.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/34be93c41e2702b48775307aeeae2aa8146c05c4f5ce43297a2ceb45124809e7.jpg"],"titleId":"010036800e994000","dlc":[]}